# ⚽ Football Stats Hub

Full-stack web application for exploring football teams, players and statistics.

## 🚀 Tech Stack

### Frontend

- React
- Vite
- React Router
- Axios
- TanStack Query

### Backend

- Node.js
- Express
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

## ✨ Planned Features

- User registration and login
- JWT authentication
- Role-based access control
- Football teams
- Football players
- Player statistics
- Live scores
- Favorites
- Personalized dashboard
- Admin panel
- Data visualization
- Filtering and sorting
- CSV/PDF export
- Dark/Light mode
- Responsive design
- Testing
- Security
- Deployment

